    "synopsis": {
        "native": "C\u00e9line, Thomas et Maxence marchent toujours par trois. Comme la trilogie de la devise r\u00e9publicaine. Ils veulent se marier, une maison, un travail, des enfants sages et manger tous les jours des hu\u00eetres. Insoumis et inadapt\u00e9s \u00e0 une furieuse r\u00e9alit\u00e9 \u00e9conomique et administrative, ils chevauchent leurs quads de feu et traversent une France accabl\u00e9e, en qu\u00eate de nouveaux rep\u00e8res, de d\u00e9serts jonch\u00e9s de bip\u00e8des et d\u2019instants de bonheur \u00e9ph\u00e9m\u00e8re.",
        "english": "C\u00e9line, Thomas, and Maxence have always operated as a trio, like the trilogy of the republicain motto of France. They want to get married, have a house, a job, well-behaved children, and to eat oysters every day. Rebellious and not suited to violent economic and administrative reality, they climb on their motorbikes and travel through a despondent France, searching for new markers, deserts strewn with bipeds, and moments of ephemeral happpiness."
